Não me lembro.

179
00:21:42,456 --> 00:21:43,932
Aquele homem...

180
00:21:44,016 --> 00:21:45,452
Quem era ele?

181
00:21:49,376 --> 00:21:50,652
Vieram me buscar?

182
00:21:54,176 --> 00:21:55,532
Vamos ajudá-la.

183
00:21:56,256 --> 00:21:57,612
Sim.

184
00:21:58,736 --> 00:22:00,372
